/*
 * Core engine for implicit template specialization in Ymir.
 *
 * TemplateImplicitSolving is responsible for inferring template parameter
 * bindings when a template is instantiated without explicit template arguments.
 * It performs structural matching between:
 *
 *   - the template parameter list(syntactic parameters),
 *   - the actual argument list(runtime values or types),
 *   - the expected types derived from the call site.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve::implicit
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve/implicit.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-09
